{"id":"steam-1064350","steam":1064350,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"The Knight of Twilight","summary":"A single-player action RPG where you rise from a nameless knight into a warrior-mage. Pour points into strength for steel or energy for magic, carve through crypts, mines and castles in short quests, and become the last light against an awakening evil.","about":"Evil has awakened, and the darkness spreads further every night. You begin as a young knight with no name and no glory. Level by level, you decide how much of you is warrior and how much is mage, until you are worthy of an order whose name is still a whisper. A villager asks for help. You cross the village, find the gate and step through the portal that carries you into the dungeon. Each quest is short and focused: take it, clear the dungeon and return, all in a single sitting.\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\nCrypts full of mummies and restless skeletons. Forgotten mines overrun by goblins and kobolds. Fallen castles ruled by ogres and worse. Every dungeon is a chain of catacombs and arenas, and every arena is a fight for your life.\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\nEach level brings new points to spend. Pour them into strength to swing heavier steel, or into energy to unleash stronger magic. Learn skills from ancient books, and equip the weapons, shields and armor you tear from the dungeon's grip.\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\nAt the end of every dungeon, the lord who rules it awaits you. Defeat it and a portal opens to bring you back. Return to the villager for gold and experience, then take on the next quest. Your level, skills, gear and story are saved, and nothing starts from scratch.\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\n\r\n• One hybrid class: a knight and a mage at once, shaped by your choices as you level\r\n• Classic dungeons, each guarded by its own boss\r\n• Short, focused quests that fit in a single sitting\r\n• Loot and gear that grow stronger with every dungeon\r\n• Several continents, from volcanoes to frozen lands, with secret quests hidden for those who explore\r\n• Single-player, with Steam Cloud saves\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\nThis game was born from my adventures in Ultima Online, a 1998 MMORPG I played for years. There was a guild there I deeply admired, honorable and almost legendary. Joining them was my dream, but I never made it in.\n\r\n\nThe Knight of Twilight is my way of making that dream come true. Every detail carries deep meaning for me, and the game is being made with a lot of love and care.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/96eed4d13e5e5c8c5541038cf817cd83d0c116a0/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794692725","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/583cc794a023b77a7bbb9411e318f70abf5256fe/header.jpg?t=1794692725","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/7be632fd8b380a026247f43f639dfff8b30d8e51/library_hero.jpg?t=1794692725","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/583cc794a023b77a7bbb9411e318f70abf5256fe/header.jpg?t=1794692725","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/213179e427fb813087e1ce08e3856103edb65a7c/ss_213179e427fb813087e1ce08e3856103edb65a7c.600x338.jpg?t=1794692725","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/213179e427fb813087e1ce08e3856103edb65a7c/ss_213179e427fb813087e1ce08e3856103edb65a7c.jpg?t=1794692725"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/94bdb85f01a845d73ce95736d03c01179d9f763a/ss_94bdb85f01a845d73ce95736d03c01179d9f763a.600x338.jpg?t=1794692725","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/94bdb85f01a845d73ce95736d03c01179d9f763a/ss_94bdb85f01a845d73ce95736d03c01179d9f763a.jpg?t=1794692725"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064350/33b149a484